        "heading": "Entity and verification",
        "body": "Four fields fix who is selling and where the goods come from. The written quotation states the legal entity, the authorized contact and the production origin. Both sides confirm the business licence in writing before order approval. A buyer should treat a missing legal entity as a stop sign. Everything downstream depends on knowing which company signed.",
