        "heading": "Per-batch quality evidence",
        "body": "Six fields make a quality claim checkable against a specific lot. The written quotation states grade and quality tier, evenness, cleanness, neatness and lot mark. Both sides confirm the grading certificate per lot in writing before order approval. **A grading certificate** is the per-lot document that records the test result for that lot. Without the lot mark, a grade is a word with nothing attached to it.",
